.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221209/677959786596274176903264.png/bL2flLsVJ9qXNwYOkblRWZwv3V4Wwd3JmQ75QpkO-UI\"/><figcaption>令人崩潰的酒店狀況Top10（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"令人崩潰的酒店狀況Top10（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221209/677959771005128704172680.png/_HL4S1L21aT5_ET4USNVbBgAQXxISjxCoHpMGaB6TBk\"/><figcaption>令人崩潰的酒店狀況Top10（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"令人崩潰的酒店狀況Top10（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221209/677959768005939200690837.png/gtxkkq0MJ2HslJuMmZfog9733Kyq4NGy7TObJe0zmyU\"/><figcaption>令人崩潰的酒店狀況Top10（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"令人崩潰的酒店狀況Top10（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221209/677959773387624448245089.png/PjSs4UsRrXMnmWNCkI3kRXwI-U1KkZ5EkRJVhZESVYU\"/><figcaption>令人崩潰的酒店狀況Top10（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「Japaholic」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-04T07:18:23.597961+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2329,"images":40,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}